note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note Pure seeded OM-2 Visor V1 lane 1: read-only semantic inspection.
note Port of src/visor/visor_semantic.c. Nothing here writes to the graph.
note Ids are passed in v_tmp_id ("_tmp" entry points) or as an object index
note (the index's id is looked up again, so the first object with that id
note answers, as omega_graph_find_object). One object view is kept in the
note vsem_v_* globals; the formatters render it into v_ob.

